{
  "notes": "candidate-55 at tp4-ring with overlay/ (the WO and COMP L2 prefetch windows sized by row band) and VLLM_DS41_L2_PREFETCH_WO_BANDS=17-32=10: 10 MB for forwards of 17 to 32 rows, the recipe's 15 MB elsewhere; unpromoted experiment",
